    Reproduce Mean bypassing the declared slowest-hundredth rule
    
    A fixed vector of 99 samples at 1000 ns and one at 1000000 ns must
    summarize to 1000 ns. The shared helper does; Mean::of preaggregates
    all samples and produces 10990 ns. Preserve this deliberately failing
    regression fixture before repairing the common value construction.

